<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia mostly steady in light trade.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia mostly steady in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP and ammonia prices were mostly nominally unchanged Monday in light trading, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>Trading was subdued, but several dealers expect a seasonal increase in sales to begin by next week.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  175-177		     dn 2-unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    188-189		     unc-up 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	  220-225		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
